  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 2.1,
      "e": 3.84,
      "text": "Years and years that it took"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.84,
      "e": 4.84,
      "text": "to get to this point,"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.84,
      "e": 7.64,
      "text": "and we finally crossed that milestone."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.64,
      "e": 8.84,
      "text": "All the work and the build up,"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.84,
      "e": 9.61,
      "text": "getting the airplane"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.61,
      "e": 10.94,
      "text": "to this point and then,"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.94,
      "e": 12.48,
      "text": "to see that take to the sky"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.48,
      "e": 13.98,
      "text": "for the first time."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.98,
      "e": 16.62,
      "text": "So, when it came to game day,"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.62,
      "e": 17.98,
      "text": "I wasn't worried about anything"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.98,
      "e": 20.99,
      "text": "because I knew the team had my back."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.59,
      "e": 22.55,
      "text": "it has the promise"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.55,
      "e": 24.59,
      "text": "to be a historic milestone"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.59,
      "e": 26.13,
      "text": "towards the next era"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.13,
      "e": 28.76,
      "text": "of commercial aviation."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.76,
      "e": 30.16,
      "text": "I've worked with so many people"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.16,
      "e": 31.33,
      "text": "for so long,"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.33,
      "e": 32.33,
      "text": "to make this happen,"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.33,
      "e": 34.33,
      "text": "to actually see it take flight."
    },
    {
      "s": 34.33,
      "e": 36.97,
      "text": "What an experience!"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.97,
      "e": 38.94,
      "text": "It's a tremendous accomplishment"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.94,
      "e": 41.94,
      "text": "for all of us associated with X-59."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.21,
      "e": 44.08,
      "text": "What we're doing has impacts"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.08,
      "e": 46.01,
      "text": "on the commercial aviation industry"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.01,
      "e": 47.71,
      "text": "and has the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.71,
      "e": 50.72,
      "text": "to revolutionize commercial air travel."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.72,
      "e": 52.69,
      "text": "To go prove a concept"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.69,
      "e": 54.29,
      "text": "that at one point"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.29,
      "e": 56.26,
      "text": "people doubted could be done."
    },
    {
      "s": 56.26,
      "e": 57.52,
      "text": "Pretty exciting."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.52,
      "e": 58.76,
      "text": "I never would have guessed"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.76,
      "e": 60.06,
      "text": "when I was 16 years old"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.06,
      "e": 61.56,
      "text": "and I wanted to be a test pilot,"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.56,
      "e": 63.83,
      "text": "that I'd ever have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.83,
      "e": 65.13,
      "text": "to do a first flight,"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.13,
      "e": 67.6,
      "text": "let alone a first flight on an X-plane."
    }
